## Implementation Notes
- When selecting a feature for implementation, choose one marked as `[planned]` or `[ready]`
- Update the feature's status to `[in-progress]` in its file when work begins
- Continue updating the status as it progresses through the TDD workflow
- The AI Directive Tree tracks workflow progress with its own status system ([to-do], [in-progress], [done])
- These two status systems are separate but synchronized through the TDD workflow 